      "beat_id": "B01",
      "act": "IDEA",
      "role_note": "Software Walkthrough scene, section IDEA",
      "narration_text": "Here is what it does, and why it matters. Early Bird will watch the career pages of the twenty-five to thirty companies I choose, and tell me only about postings that are new. I want to apply to every software and A I role, so the problem is not too many jobs. The problem is missing one. A posting can go up, and I only find out days later. Early Bird will make sure I hear about each new role the next time I run it, with referrals first, then freshness, then how well it matches my own projects. The roles on screen are sample data.",
