      "beat_id": "B02",
      "act": "LANDSCAPE",
      "role_note": "Software Walkthrough scene, section LANDSCAPE",
      "narration_text": "So what already exists? Here are three kinds of tools. Job alert emails, which I expect to be broad and often late. Job trackers, which I expect to record where I applied, but not find new postings. And scripts that watch one kind of job board. I ran one of these, greenhouse watch, on my Commure snapshots. It kept a marketing job, because the posting mentioned Python and S Q L. That is the gap Early Bird will close, by reading each posting with Claude. Early Bird will use my list, show only what is new, and put referrals first.",
